<!-- Release title
# GNU Make for Windows <VERSION>
-->

Unofficial builds of [GNU Make](https://www.gnu.org/software/make/) <UPSTREAM-VERSION> for Windows, compiled without GNU Guile support

| Category         | Minimum requirement                       |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Operating system | Windows 10                                |
| CPU (AMD64)      | AVX2 (e.g., Intel Haswell, AMD Excavator) |
| CPU (AArch64)    | Armv8.2-A                                 |

The release executables are licensed under the [GNU General Public License, version 3](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html) or later. Their corresponding source code consists of the [upstream source code](<SOURCE-ARCHIVE-URL>) and this repository's [patches and build scripts](<REPOSITORY-URL>/tree/v<VERSION>).
